@startuml
' Source block: uml251_06_activities (uml-2.5.1-legend.puml intake)
!include ../../../../tooling/styles/plantuml/behavioral/activity-diagram-style.iuml
' ============================================================================
' Section 06 — Activities
'
' UML traceability:
'   UML 2.5.1 §15.2 Activities
'   UML 2.5.1 §15.3 Control Nodes
'   UML 2.5.1 §15.4 Object Nodes
'   UML 2.5.1 §15.6 Activity Groups / Partitions / Interruptible Regions
'   UML 2.5.1 §16 Actions
'
' PlantUML support: Native/Partial.
' IMPORTANT:
'   PlantUML "if"/fork/swimlane constructs render UML-like notation,
'   but ControlFlow/ObjectFlow semantics are model semantics, not
'   automatically encoded by the renderer.
' ============================================================================

title UML 2.5.1 Notation Reference — Activities
skinparam monochrome true

|Customer|
start
:Submit order;

|System|
:order : Order
«object»;

if (valid?) then (yes)
  fork
    :Reserve inventory;
  fork again
    :Authorize payment
«sendSignal»;
  end fork

  :Await settlement event
«acceptEvent»;

  group InterruptibleActivityRegion
    :Fulfill order;
    :Cancellation trigger
«trigger»;
  end group

  :Complete order;
else (no)
  :Reject order;
endif

stop

legend
  |= UML node / edge |= Meaning |= PlantUML mapping |
  | InitialNode | starts flow when Activity begins | start — Native shape |
  | ActivityFinalNode | terminates all flows in the Activity | stop — Partial mapping |
  | FlowFinalNode | terminates only the arriving flow; UML symbol is circle-with-X | No documented first-class keyword |
  | DecisionNode | one incoming, multiple outgoing; chooses by guards | if — Native visual mapping |
  | MergeNode | multiple incoming, one outgoing; combines alternatives | endif/merge layout — Partial |
  | ForkNode | one incoming, multiple outgoing concurrent flows | fork — Native |
  | JoinNode | multiple incoming, one outgoing synchronization | end fork — Native |
  | ActivityPartition | responsibility/organizational partition ("swimlane") | swimlane syntax — Native |
  | ObjectNode | holds object tokens; rectangle | <<object>> UML shape — Native renderer support |
  | SendSignalAction | sends a Signal asynchronously | <<sendSignal>> UML shape — Native renderer support |
  | AcceptEventAction | waits for specified Event occurrence | <<acceptEvent>> UML shape — Native renderer support |
  | ControlFlow | flow of control tokens | ordinary activity edge — semantics not encoded |
  | ObjectFlow | flow of object/value tokens | ordinary edge via ObjectNode — Partial |
  | InterruptibleActivityRegion | dashed rounded region; interrupting edge has lightning/zig-zag adornment | grouping only — Approximation |
endlegend
@enduml
